id=gpumem-abort-fix
name=GPU-mem abort fix (libmeminfo)
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=rawflux
description=Patches libmeminfo so ReadPerProcessGpuMem degrades gracefully instead of abort()ing when the gpu_mem eBPF map is absent (this MTK kernel has no gpu_mem_total tracepoint). Stops the hourly system_server soft-reboot. 2-byte patch, built on-device at install; see docs/09.
